    "text": "In the part of the circuit shown in the figure, the potential difference between points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.&nbsp;The current passing through the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>&nbsp;resistance will be<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0032_95b1133cc488.jpg\" style=\"width: 260px; height: 118px;\" />"
