    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0032_703f4703ca17.jpg\" style=\"width: 260px; height: 121px;\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ......(i)<br /><br />Using Kirchhoff's second law in the closed loops we have<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ......(ii)<br /><br />Solving equations (i) and (ii), we get<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;Current through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>&nbsp;resistor <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>"
